From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:43:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] role: take calls from luna-send only

Every method of this service is also in the ACG "all", so "inbound":
["*"] left bus capture (ls2Monitor, dbusCapture), the log (getMessages,
tailMessages, clearMessages) and setLogging open to every holder of that
group: the application manager, System UI and the notification app. None
of them calls this service. Lumberjack's own app has no recipe and is on
no image.

Answer luna-send alone, which is only root's (0700), so the service
stays usable from a shell. The hub expands the pattern to com.palm.*,
org.webosports.* and the other legacy prefixes itself. ls-monitor needs
no entry: the hub always lets the monitor through.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/org.webosports.service.lumberjack.role.json.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/files/sysbus/org.webosports.service.lumberjack.role.json.in b/files/sysbus/org.webosports.service.lumberjack.role.json.in
index 1de4a78..d40278f 100644
--- a/files/sysbus/org.webosports.service.lumberjack.role.json.in
+++ b/files/sysbus/org.webosports.service.lumberjack.role.json.in
@@ -6,7 +6,7 @@
     "permissions": [
     {
         "service":"org.webosports.service.lumberjack",
-        "inbound":["*"],
+        "inbound":["com.webos.lunasend-*"],
         "outbound":["*"]
     }
   ]
